# This repository is the integration recipe, not the payload.
# The image, the model weights and the vehicle data all ship out of band.
# See "What is not in this repository" in README.md for why each one is excluded.

# --- The built image and anything docker save produces -------------------
# The tarball is 12 GB. GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB on push.
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip

# --- The staged build context --------------------------------------------
# build.sh assembles this from the live source trees at build time.
# It is ~1.3 GB and every byte of it is reproducible, so it is never committed.
ctx/

# --- Vendored third-party source -----------------------------------------
# perception_suite and offroad_autonomy belong to their authors.
# build.sh copies them into the context from their own checkouts.
# Committing a copy here would fork them silently.
felix/
bryan/
bench/

# --- Model weights and TensorRT engines ----------------------------------
# 395 MB, and the .engine files are serialized against one exact TensorRT
# build, so they are worthless on a board with a different JetPack.
*.pt
*.onnx
*.engine

# --- Vehicle data: do not commit -----------------------------------------
# The clips are footage recorded from the HATCI vehicle.
# The CAN CSVs carry lat/lon columns, so they are a GPS trace of it.
# Publishing either is HATCI's call to make, not ours.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.csv
*.mcap
*.bag
*.db3

# --- Build and run artifacts ---------------------------------------------
*.log
.build-done
.selftest*-done
.save-done
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
build/
install/
log/

# --- macOS ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
